WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
 I'm gonna second what he said because a

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.140
 huge challenge is getting people to come

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.960
 out for more than just like resources.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.780
 Like people are in need and so like

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.150
 they're more likely to come out for the

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.680
 things that they need to get. Like we

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.300
 have back-to-school drives, we have all

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.600
 these different resource fairs, people

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.940
 will always come out for those but it's a

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.140
 matter of trying to get people to

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.560
 continue to come out for the things like

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.200
 health workshops, screening opportunities,

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.110
 all of these opportunities and moments

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:26.960
 and like that's really the challenge

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.870
 because people are also disenfranchised

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.280
 like they don't really have the time to

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.070
 come out to learn about these things to

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.320
 pursue these opportunities and so it's

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.280
 like how do we a) build that trust but

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.600
 then build those bridges to make this a

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.840
 convenient experience for them as well.

